partial influence of westerly winds. In addition, a strong low-pressure system (Depression) is currently located over north Maharashtra and adjoining Chhattisgarh. The system is likely to move north-northwestwards and gradually weaken into a low-pressure system during the next 24 hours.\n"},"text":{"ne":"देशभर अधिकांश बादल लाग्नेछ। गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा तथा कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका पहाडी र तराई भू-भागका र कर्णाली प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा, मधेश तथा कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको पहाडी र तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका थोरै स्थानमा भारी देखि धेरै भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा अति भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेश तथा बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा हावाहुरीको समेत सम्भावना छ ।\n\n\n","en":" Mostly cloudy conditions will prevail throughout the country. Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the Himalayan areas of Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at many places in the Himalayan areas of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the hilly and Terai areas of Gandaki, Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces and the hilly areas of Karnali Province, and at some places in Madhesh Province and the hilly and Terai areas of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces. Heavy to very heavy rainfall is likely at a few places in Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Extremely heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Windstorms are also likely at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai areas of Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces.      "}},"sources":{"dhm_country":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_city":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_obs":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T17:45:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_3day":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_mountain":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_pages":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_river":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_rain":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"},"model":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:53+05:45","status":"ok"}}}